PositionFactory::createPosition(PositionType,bytes)
├── when beacon is not set for positionType
│   └── it should revert with PositionFactoryUnsupportedType
├── when positionType is MINT_CURVE_CONVEX
│   ├── when market is not a registered mint market
│   │   └── it should revert with PositionFactoryUnsupportedMarket
│   └── when market is a registered mint market
│       ├── it should deploy a BeaconProxy for msg.sender
│       ├── it should initialize the position with msg.sender as owner
│       ├── it should initialize the position with address(this) as factory
│       ├── it should initialize the position with the decoded market
│       └── it should emit PositionCreated
└── when positionType is unsupported
    └── it should revert with PositionFactoryUnsupportedType
